<title>UK: Copper slides under $2,400, still ends LME higher.</title>
<headline>Copper slides under $2,400, still ends LME higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Finishes higher after less volatile session. But close under $2,400 not seen constructive.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Closes steadier, stalls at $1,580.</p>
<p>ZINC - Finishes firm, near new seven-year peak.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Ends steadier, awaits news from Inco.</p>
<p>LEAD - Closes slightly higher. TIN - Ends lower.</p>
</text>
